<title>MEXICO: Berol to pay 10 pesos per-share dividend.</title>
<headline>Berol to pay 10 pesos per-share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pen and pencil manufacturere Berol SA de CV said in a press statement on Wednesday it will pay a cash dividend of 10 pesos per share on June 18, as agreed at an annual general meeting held on Dec. 10, 1996.</p>
<p>Berol shares last traded on Sept. 3, 1996, when they closed at 34.05 pesos. (( --Tomas de la Rosa, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7912))</p>
